BASE="Raw unedited smartphone recording on a tripod, vertical, one continuous take, no cuts, no music, no subtitles, no text on screen. The man from the reference images (same face, same short dark hair and beard), Dani, a 34-year-old Spanish personal trainer wearing a forest-green t-shirt, in a small bright neighbourhood gym with kettlebells and a rack behind him, natural daylight. He talks to camera in Spanish from Spain (Castilian accent), warm, close and natural, like a real creator recording a reel draft: real pauses of one to two seconds of silence, hesitations, looks away to think, then back to camera. Only his voice and soft room tone."
A='He says: "Eh… vale. Si tienes cuarenta y tantos y poco tiempo…" (pause, silence, he shakes his head) "Espera, lo repito." (silence, he looks back to camera) "Si tienes más de cuarenta y poco tiempo, escucha esto." (pause, two seconds of silence) "Mejor dos días bien… que cinco a medias."'
B='He says: "Mira, la mayoría de mis clientes empiezan queriendo entrenar cinco días…" (pause, silence) "y a las tres semanas lo dejan." (he looks to the side, silence) "Eh… con dos sesiones de cuarenta minutos, bien hechas, ya ganas fuerza." (two seconds of silence) "Escríbeme y te cuento cómo."'
FRONT="Static medium shot from the waist up, frontal, eye level, he is centred in frame."
SIDE="Static close-up from the chest up, camera at a three-quarter angle from his left, he looks at a point just off-camera, as a second camera recording the same talk."
